  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients except Trace vitamins, NaHCO3, sulfur and Na2S・9H2O, adjust pH to 7.5 -- 8.0 and autoclave. Filter--sterilize Trace vitamins and 5% NaHCO3 solution and add to the medium. Steam sulfur for 3 hr on each of 3 successive days. Separately autoclave 5% Na2S・9H2O solution under a N2 atmosphere. Distribute the medium into culture vessels containing appropriate amount of sulfur (e.g., 20 ml of medium in 120 ml serum bottles containing 0.6 g sulfur) under a stream of H2--CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas mixture andseal with butyl rubber stoppers. Aseptically and anaerobically add the sterile Na2S solution. Pressurize the inoculated bottle to 200 kPa H2--CO2 (4:1, v/v)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Dissolve nitrilotriacetic acid and adjust pH to 6.5 with KOH. Then proceed to add minerals. Adjust final pH to 7.0."
    }
  ]
}